  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_ac62aa48-70c4-4f1d-8c32-a1fa00b93433.png\" alt=\"Tough As Nails 標誌\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fglitchfiend.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_c0ac8421-76cc-495e-a72e-acee3ea9954c.png\" alt=\"在 Bluesky 上追蹤\" width=\"220\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fGlitchfiend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_452403c6-3e00-4724-9374-3bc2cc63c95c.png\" alt=\"在 X 上追蹤\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_ad556c43-5917-431a-8235-9b35362bb4e9.png\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_6f92a5cd-9aaa-413d-977a-17f1d8514f5f.png\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持\" width=\"236\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dAdubbzG%2540gmail.com%2526cy_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_fa447003-984d-4019-abd1-9672a3bc22a6.png\" alt=\"透過 PayPal 捐贈\" width=\"218\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<h2>遊戲說明</h2>\n<hr>\n<h4>Tough As Nails 是一款生存模組，新增了多種功能以提升遊戲難度，包含體溫與口渴系統。</h4>\n<h3>注意：體溫機制在 1.16 版本中無法使用！</h3>\n<h2>資訊與條款</h2>\n<hr>\n<h3>Minecraft 1.20.4 及以上版本*需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_495a5f28-8271-4409-8b44-eb0f4ff99ea7.png\" alt=\"GlitchCore 圖示\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a>！Fabric 版本則需安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</h3>\n<p><em>*mod 版本 9.2.0.171 及以上版本亦適用於 1.20.1</em></p>\n<p><em>您可以將此模組收錄於由 CurseForge 託管的整合包中，前提是不得重新託管本模組、僅使用我們直接上傳的構建版本、不出售整合包或透過任何方式販售額外模組存取權，並遵守您所用模組版本的許可證中所列的所有條款。</em></p>\n<h2>更多由 Glitchfiend 開發的模組</h2>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_536c8bbe-66d9-4d24-86f7-e65b8e346053.png\" alt=\"Biomes O' Plenty 標誌\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_afd5e266-e85c-4127-99cf-84092e4adbd5.png\" alt=\"Serene Seasons 標誌\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a></p>",
